        "notes": "Contract steps fully enumerated through expiration (3% annual increases each May 1); steps before the as-of date omitted per spec convention. In-place rent (~$19.71/SF/yr in 2026) sits roughly 35% ABOVE market for functionally comparable space — the income stream amortizes the land basis while the lease runs. On the 2036 expiry the underwriting does not re-lease: the hold ends at lease expiry and the exit is a land-value reversion."
